{"channelId":"UCfQ5dnrGzn4UzFdVj0mBRhQ","row":["OH2021SchoolofAppliedScienceTP",40,"Welcome to the School of Applied Science (ASC), where science is brought to life! \n\nASC offers 5 full-time diplomas in response to the dynamic changes in the vibrant food, chemical, healthcare and life sciences industries. To ensure our students stay relevant and competitive in a rapidly global world, our ability-driven curriculum strives to develop a future-oriented creator, lifelong learner and values-centred leader. The School has identified niche areas in applied research to accelerate the professional growth of its staff and keep abreast of the latest developments. Through the strong industry affiliations and collaborations by our Centres of Excellence, they bring some of the latest research and development opportunities to our doorstep. Often undertaken with industrial involvement, these projects offer a platform for multi-disciplinary technical teams of staff and students to collaborate and innovate.\n\nIf you have a passion for science or research, come join us!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfQ5dnrGzn4UzFdVj0mBRhQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfQ5dnrGzn4UzFdVj0mBRhQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:44.488Z","channelId":"UCfQ5dnrGzn4UzFdVj0mBRhQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ebcf347ee6664ce6f72fe9c8e8d76891af77a8ce849ea28c2b07ec18c1cf9900","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"25691d3caca69d59cc75d130451ac2c6e2b383f3d4a0567fce35dfc731b3e51a"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfQ5dnrGzn4UzFdVj0mBRhQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":40,"raw":"40 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfQ5dnrGzn4UzFdVj0mBRhQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:44.488Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinari